(text "Card detect: the socket's switch is normally open and closes with a card in, pulling SD_nCD low against R163." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c214fd35-1bf9-593f-a88b-d666efd26519"))
(text "SD_WP pulled down (R164): the checklist says this is needed to write to microSD. D4-D7 float (4-bit card)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 245.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6f665096-3a10-5743-9505-1dfd77e00c72"))
(text "Reset: 10k / 1u to 3.3 V as in the checklist's figure; a reset after power-up is not required." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 248.92000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c8429578-8c08-5bef-a9a2-91b3e277ab96"))
(text "No configuration EEPROM: internal defaults. SDA/SCK pulled up so a probe for an EEPROM sees an idle bus (the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 252.73000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1d2d9f3a-1213-5351-b688-10511876d031"))
(text "checklist does not say what to do with them; this is an assumption). Crystal: 24 MHz, CL 10 pF, 18 pF loads." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "87f23a66-97d9-55fe-929a-9ebbec10ba84"))
(text "Powered from +3V3, not +5V as the block netlist had it: the chip runs from 3.3 V and makes its own 1.8 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 260.35 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "270b8fe9-038a-5091-a365-a8ee771bfbce"))
(text "No ESD parts on the card lines; add them if the slot is reachable in normal use." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e350879c-ef45-5ec2-ad49-13d0ed1b9de9"))
